  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Compared with other hairy man Gu Immortals in Lang Ya Sect, he is special: he cultivates refinement path and also enslavement path. In his early years a failed refinement produced a new Gu embryo; after immortal ascension he raised it to rank six, named it Immortal Slave, and used it to add enslavement path dao marks to his body. The previous Lang Ya land spirit encouraged that dual cultivation because those dao marks help when refining enslavement path Immortal Gu. The current Lang Ya land spirit favors him even more for battle strength, gives him beast enslavement Immortal Gu, and intends to nurture him as the sect’s enslavement path battle strength; among that land spirit’s favorites, Twelfth Hair is the most well-liked.",
      "chapters": [
        1080
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "gu_immortal_slave_gu",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_beast_enslavement_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While sparring Fang Yuan he summons a chestnut yak with that Immortal Gu, struggles through failed activations, and only then forces the yak into a charge that Fang Yuan’s flying bear form defeats.",
      "chapters": [
        1080
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During Lang Ya Sect’s attack on the falling star hound, Twelfth Hair leads the group: he activates the teleportation Gu formation to Tai Qiu, then uses three desolate beasts to hold the hound’s attention while the other hairy man Gu Immortals attack it from hiding.",
      "chapters": [
        1134
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "loc_tai_qiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Lang Ya Sect’s hairy man Gu Immortals at Fire Plain grotto-heaven, rank six Twelfth Hair performs best by cultivating enslavement path secondarily and controlling multiple desolate beasts.",
      "chapters": [
        2107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fire_plain_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a hairy man Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        885
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even his hair cannot conceal his expression when Lian Ke Xin praises the sovereign immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        2243
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lian_ke_xin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During Qin Bai Sheng’s assault on Lang Ya blessed land, Twelfth Hair and Thirteenth Hair surround Qin Bai Sheng protectively and help the enemy. Other hairy man Gu Immortals call them traitors and refuse to believe it, saying both grew up in the blessed land. Lang Ya land spirit orders them killed. After the attackers withdraw, the two join Shadow Sect talk: with soul replacement they can possess more undercover agents, they only managed three hairy man Gu Immortal moles, and with two exposed they would need at least three hundred years to accumulate more.",
      "chapters": [
        885
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exposed-as-traitors",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_thirteenth_hair",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the sovereign immortal aperture he tells Lian Ke Xin and Yu Zi that he lives on Yellow Hair Continent and leads the yellow hair hairy men. He and Lian Ke Xin take a mission to nurture Gu Immortal seeds and enter a mountain forest where a wounded hairy man Gu Master is being chased. Twelfth Hair names him Gu Yue Fang Xiang, son of Gu Yue Fang Zheng rather than Fang Yuan’s bloodline, and says Fang Yuan has been secretly nurturing him with opportunities and setbacks as the most qualified Gu Immortal seed among their hairy man Gu Masters.",
      "chapters": [
        2243
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yellow-hair-residence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_zi",
        "loc_yellow_hair_continent",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_gu_yue_fang_xiang",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    }
  ],
